  "notes": [
    "effectiveFrom is the first Asia/Taipei day this price is applied. Launch dates of the models were not verified; they are set to the start of 2026, before any usage of these models can exist. Add a NEW entry with a later effectiveFrom when a vendor changes a price; never edit an old entry (stored costs are never recomputed).",
    "Claude 1h cache write = 2x input, 5m write = 1.25x input; cache read is 0.05x input on Opus 5.5 / Sonnet 5.5 and 0.1x on Haiku 5.5 (official page footnote 2).",
    "fastMultiplier applies to every bucket (the official page states cache multipliers stack on top of fast mode pricing).",
    "longContext replaces the base rates for a single request whose prompt (input + cache read + cache writes) is over thresholdTokens. OpenAI: 2x input and cached input, 1.5x output over 272K.",
    "Re-checked 2026-10-15: gpt-5.1-codex-mini and gpt-5-codex are still absent from the official page; their rates come from the LiteLLM snapshot and stay verified:false. Fast-tier multipliers: 2x on gpt-5.6/6.x/5.4/5.4-mini/5.3-codex/5.2/5.1/5/5-mini; 2.5x gpt-5.5; 1.75x o3; ~1.8x o4-mini; none listed for *-nano."
